WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.780
Drive Impact lands and crumples the opponent.

2
00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:02.280
Dhalsim dashes forward during the crumple.

3
00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:02.780
Crouching heavy punch connects at close range.

4
00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:03.580
